review_text:
its surely pricey for an hour+ of air ride but 
* the views are goegeous, the ice-rock-and-clouds combo is mesmerizing; 
* the denali tip is so good if you look at it from above the clouds; 
* landing on the glacier is fun and crazy if you really value where you are standing., and of course outstanding backgrounds for your photoes :)
* they give the rubber boots to wear on top of your shoes, so you can walk peacefully on the snow; 
* pilot makes sure you know what you are seeing; 
* and don't forget the tip the pilot and other staff :)
